      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naval_Construction_Battalion_Center_Port_Hueneme"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Seabee Museum at the base houses the principal repository of Seabee operational history, including oral histories and battalion records.",
